Package: ONgeoR
Title: Resolve Ontario Locations to Public Health Geography
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Lennon", "Li", email = "lennon.li@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a reproducible framework for retrieving Ontario
    geospatial boundaries and facility locations from authoritative external
    sources (such as the Ontario GeoHub LIO REST services), linking points
    and polygons to public-health geography (Public Health Units, Ontario
    Health Regions), and building auditable crosswalk tables with full
    source provenance. ONgeoR does not bundle geospatial data; all data is
    retrieved at runtime from external sources.
